File Classification & Inventory
--------------------------------

1. Vendored / Derived Algorithm Code (ported from FAUST):
   The following files implement the cpPmden taut-string density estimation machinery
   derived from FAUST (master branch at https://github.com/RGLab/FAUST):

   - src/cpPmden.cpp
     Primary taut-string piecewise-constant density estimator (cpPmden).
     Derived from FAUST `src/cpPmden.cpp`. Ported from `ftnonpar::pmden`.
   - src/tautstring.cpp
     Taut-string computation routine (tautString).
     Derived from FAUST `src/tautstring.cpp`. Ported from `ftnonpar` `strings.c`.
   - src/kkuiper.cpp
     Kuiper distance and interval calculation (kkuiper, easymax, difficultmax).
     Derived from FAUST `src/kkuiper.cpp`. Ported from `ftnonpar` `kkuip.c`.
   - src/local_density.cpp
     Local density test / knot lookup helper (local_density).
     Derived from FAUST `src/local_density.cpp`. Ported from `ftnonpar` `denlocal.f`.
   - src/cppApprox.cpp
     Linear interpolation helper (cppApprox). Restricted port of base R `approx`.
     Derived from FAUST `src/cppApprox.cpp`.
   - src/medianAbsoluteDeviation.cpp
     Median absolute deviation helper (medianAbsoluteDeviation).
     Derived from FAUST `src/medianAbsoluteDeviation.cpp`.
   - src/rQuantile.cpp
     Sample quantile calculation helper (rQuantile, Type 7).
     Derived from FAUST `src/rQuantile.cpp`.

2. StimGate Integration & Wrapper Code:
   The following files were written specifically for `stimgate` to interface with
   the vendored FAUST implementation and are licensed under GPL (>= 3):

   - src/stimgate_cppmden.cpp
     cpp11 R-interface wrapper function (`stimgate_cpPmden()`) exposing `cpPmden` to R.
   - src/stimgate_faust.h
     Minimal package-local header containing declarations and data structures (`stringInfo`)
     required by the vendored files. Replaces full FAUST headers.
   - src/faust.h
     Thin redirection header including `stimgate_faust.h` so vendored files can retain
     `#include "faust.h"`.

3. Tooling-Generated Files:
   - src/cpp11.cpp
     Auto-generated cpp11 registration boilerplate. Generated by `cpp11::cpp_register()`.
     MIT licensed (cpp11 default). Not manually modified.


